& [AuthorityInput] is sufficient for formation only
  + parent I03 profile defines the corpus and report purpose
  + I03D defines complete ReaderPair observations without comparison fields
  + current source defines the later comparison license and replay envelope
  + I03A through I03D are not active implementation prerequisites

& [Correction1] refines same-rule wording
  + schema and typed readers expose different rule vocabularies
  + one CommonSyntaxClaim therefore owns explicit schema_witness and typed_witness mappings
  + rejected plus rejected can agree when both mapped witnesses establish the same claim, not when raw rule ids happen to be textually equal

& [Correction2] distinguishes input and output typed observations
  + three input roots compare schema validation with deserialization from exact retained bytes
  + two response roots compare schema validation of emitted bytes with actual typed serialization under distinct intended-use fixtures
  + shared ProcedureToolResponse type cannot merge base_response and preparation_response claims

& [Correction3] limits a passing claim
  + pass means every admitted finite obligation has exact expected observations zero findings and exact replay
  + it does not prove exhaustive schema-language equivalence semantic validity compatibility production readiness or authority admission

& [Correction4] makes expectation authority explicit
  + a generator or LLM may propose cases and mappings
  + canonical expectation requires reviewed source identity and later activation signature
  + generated output digest alone cannot authorize its expected result

& [Correction5] prevents report digest recursion
  + each pure run emits a self-digest-free ReportCore
  + the ReplayEnvelope binds two core digests equality and disposition
  + envelope digest is calculated over an envelope payload excluding only its own digest

& [Correction6] closes semantic evaluation
  + only I03C safe_pure bindings with exact module function code snapshot input type and proof identity may execute
  + every input fixture must already be complete and admitted
  + observational_only and prohibited_authority remain non-executing report facts

& [Correction7] closes storage behavior
  + future test fixtures are compile-time included from a signed content-addressed inventory
  + library and test execution perform no runtime file read or write
  + final core and envelope bytes remain in-memory test observations

& [Correction8] preserves implementation refusal
  + I03E formation defines no cases fixtures Rust comparator generator report or test
  + dependency and upstream activation blockers remain open

& [AuditDisposition] is source_valid_after_refinement_formation_allowed_implementation_forbidden
